om/bis-hanoi\", \"content\": \"Our graduates go on to study at prestigious top 100 universities around the world, including Yale University, Stanford University, University of Cambridge, University College London (UCL), King's College London, The London School of Economics and\\u2026\\n\\n# BRITISH INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL (BIS) HANOI\\n## EXPERIENCE INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL EXCELLENCE\\nFor the last four years at our pioneering international school in Hanoi, our IGCSE\\u00a0and IBDP\\u00a0students have scored higher than the global average. This takes them to the world\\u2019s best universities, including Cambridge, UCL, Stanford, Yale, UCB,\\u00a0the University of Melbourne, the University of Toronto, NUS, KAIST and Yonsei.\\n\\n## University Destinations\\nEquipped with outstanding IGCSE and A-level results, English fluency, and meaningful life skills, BIS Hanoi graduates go on to thrive at prestigious institutions including Yale, Stanford, and the University of Melbourne.\\n\\nStanford University\\n\\nYale University\\n\\nUniversity of Cambridge\\n\\nImperial College London\\n\\nUniversity College Lon\n",
